T["N. Stranglethorn (open-world Zul'Gurub) @ ~77.5, 44.5 – activate Torch of Pyrreth and use themed collectibles at each of the 5 Altars: Sin (Sinheart pet + Bondable Sinstone toy + Sinstone cloak), Corrupt, Lust, Blood, Void; nearby players can share credit; loot Chest of Acquisitions for Ancient Shaman Blood"] = ""
